      "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-e708253d85c5caf6dc8ad0a3",
      "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
      "label": "属性断言：For a speed control example with proportional plus integral control (D_c = k_P + k_I/s) and plant G = A/(τs+1), the loop transfer function is G D_cl(s) = A(k_P s + k_I) / (s(τs+1)). The system is Type 1 and the velocity constant is K_v = A k_I.",
